{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hnpVIjwqQS1795323230.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地快遞龍頭企業順豐速運，被暫停參加解放軍全軍採購活動。</p><p></p><p>中央軍委後勤保障部透過軍隊採購網公布指，有關部門通報，順豐速運涉嫌存在違規行為，從上周四起，要求其暫停在全軍範圍內參加物資、工程及服務採購活動。官方未公布暫停原因及期限，但其日常民用快遞服務，商業物流不受影響。</p><p></p><p>公開資料顯示，順豐曾與軍方聯勤保障部隊合作，參與軍需物流配送業務。同日受限的，還有八馬茶業等企業。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:54:37.845375+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:57:15.559654+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T05:48:06.213073+00:00","content_hash":"2e053f09e33992a3dece773db3588d9bb6122b5b726502540b36f58c8fb2ab65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:54:37.845375+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}